hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"214","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne Juma ham se pahlon par farz kiya, phir Allah ne hamen is ki hidayat di aur woh is mein ikhtilaf karne lage. To log is mein hamare tabe' hain: Yahud o Nasara."
"215","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Juma mein ek sa'at hai jo Musalman namaz padhte hue us mein Allah se khair mange magar Allah use use ata farmata hai."
"216","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Juma mein ek sa'at hai jo Musalman namaz padhte hue us mein Allah se khair mange magar Allah use use ata farmata hai jab tak woh gunah ya qata' rahmi na mange.'"
"217","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo teen Juma baghair uzr ke chhode jo use ho, us ke dil par mohar laga di jati hai.'"
"218","[AI-translation] Harisah bin Nu'man ki beti se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Beshak main ne hamara tannur aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka tannur ek hi dekha. Aur main ne «ق وَالْقُرْآنِ» Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke munh se hi seekhi; Aap is se Juma ke din mimbar par khutba dete the."
"219","[AI-translation] Tawus se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har us Musalman par jo bulughat ko pahunche Allah ke liye har saat dinon mein ek din taharat haq hai, agarche woh junubi na ho, Juma ke din apna sar aur apni khal dhoe."
"220","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Juma ke din ghusl ka zikr farmaya. Tawus ne kaha: To main ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Kya woh khushbu ya tel lagae agar us ke ghar walon ke paas ho? Unhon ne kaha: Main ise nahin janta."
